*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0029
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-03-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 447
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0029.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 C-AG-YY            PIC 9(3).
    05 L-BL               PIC 9(9)V99.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 AT-CD              PIC X.
       88 AT-FIXED VALUE 'F'.
    *> BASE INTEREST RATE
    05 S-RT               PIC 9V9999.
    05 POST-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 POST-DATE-R REDEFINES POST-DATE.
       10 POST-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 POST-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 POST-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 E-RT               PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM SENIOR-BONUS
    PERFORM 2600-FIXED-DEP
    DISPLAY "E-RT=" E-RT
    STOP RUN.
SENIOR-BONUS.
    IF C-AG-YY >= 62 AND L-BL >= 25000
        COMPUTE E-RT = S-RT + 0.0025
    ELSE
        MOVE S-RT TO E-RT
    END-IF.
2600-FIXED-DEP.
    IF AT-FIXED
        COMPUTE E-RT ROUNDED = E-RT + 0.0015
    END-IF.
